    "name": "The Vineyard Massacre",
    "steam_appid": 3594720,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594720/extras/64f88e9be7b9caedad5d458a10b55b6d.poster.avif?t=1749584178\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594720/extras/64f88e9be7b9caedad5d458a10b55b6d.webm?t=1749584178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594720/extras/64f88e9be7b9caedad5d458a10b55b6d.mp4?t=1749584178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Vineyard Massacre</strong> is a psychological survival horror experience set in the chilling halls of the <strong>Sangnoire Estate</strong>, where madness has bloomed like the cursed vines that gave the mansion its name. <br>You are <strong>Marie</strong>, a young vineyard worker, trapped in a night of unspeakable horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What began as another quiet evening turns into a desperate escape when <strong>Julien Sangnoire</strong>, the once-respected master of the house, snaps and begins <strong>hunting his staff</strong> in a frenzy of bloodshed. With no motive, no warning \u2014 only screams and the sound of dragging chains \u2014 Marie must run, hide, and uncover the twisted secrets that lie beneath the floorboards and behind locked doors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You Are Being Hunted</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594720/extras/7c57a326a23d713f39eb0be8f06c29b0.poster.avif?t=1749584178\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594720/extras/7c57a326a23d713f39eb0be8f06c29b0.webm?t=1749584178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594720/extras/7c57a326a23d713f39eb0be8f06c29b0.mp4?t=1749584178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sangnoire mansion is not just a setting \u2014 it\u2019s a <strong>living, shifting labyrinth</strong> filled with traps, hidden passages, and unnatural forces. Julien is always listening. Always adapting. If he hears you, he will come. If he sees you, he will chase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must stay quiet, stay sharp\u2026 and stay alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Spiritual-Vine Mechanism</strong> <br>Drinking the Sangnoire family wine doesn\u2019t just calm the nerves. It <strong>fractures reality</strong>, opening doors that weren\u2019t there and revealing visions from the past. But be warned: <strong>the more you drink, the harder it becomes to tell what\u2019s real.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Julien Listens and Learns</strong> <br>Julien Sangnoire is more than just a killer \u2014 he\u2019s a predator. His <strong>AI behavior adapts</strong> based on your noise, your hiding spots, and your path. Every decision matters. Every sound can be your last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vintage Survival Puzzle Design</strong> <br>Inspired by early 20th-century machinery, you\u2019ll need to manipulate <strong>pressure valves, fuse boxes, mechanical lifts, and coded drawers</strong> to open new paths and escape routes. There's no hand-holding here \u2014 only tension, logic, and survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Real-Time Horror</strong> <br>Immersive, <strong>cut-free storytelling</strong> \u2014 experience ghostly memories and death sequences in real time, with <strong>no breaks in gameplay flow.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Sangnoire Estate</strong> <br>From secret wine cellars to a forgotten chapel deep underground, the estate hides a story of <strong>grief, ritual, and madness</strong>. Each room brings you closer to the truth\u2026 and closer to Julien.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Distinct Horror Aesthetic</strong> <br>A moody 3D world soaked in dread, blending <strong>historical realism</strong> with <strong>unnatural beauty</strong> \u2014 overgrown vines, flickering oil lamps, and the bloodstained walls of a once-noble house.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594720/extras/dcb4f5e2845f70e00fbf939d8a6e72e6.poster.avif?t=1749584178\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594720/extras/dcb4f5e2845f70e00fbf939d8a6e72e6.webm?t=1749584178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594720/extras/dcb4f5e2845f70e00fbf939d8a6e72e6.mp4?t=1749584178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will you survive the Sangnoire massacre?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will your soul be trapped with the rest of the vineyard\u2019s secrets?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594720/extras/64f88e9be7b9caedad5d458a10b55b6d.poster.avif?t=1749584178\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594720/extras/64f88e9be7b9caedad5d458a10b55b6d.webm?t=1749584178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594720/extras/64f88e9be7b9caedad5d458a10b55b6d.mp4?t=1749584178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Vineyard Massacre</strong> is a psychological survival horror experience set in the chilling halls of the <strong>Sangnoire Estate</strong>, where madness has bloomed like the cursed vines that gave the mansion its name. <br>You are <strong>Marie</strong>, a young vineyard worker, trapped in a night of unspeakable horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What began as another quiet evening turns into a desperate escape when <strong>Julien Sangnoire</strong>, the once-respected master of the house, snaps and begins <strong>hunting his staff</strong> in a frenzy of bloodshed. With no motive, no warning \u2014 only screams and the sound of dragging chains \u2014 Marie must run, hide, and uncover the twisted secrets that lie beneath the floorboards and behind locked doors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You Are Being Hunted</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594720/extras/7c57a326a23d713f39eb0be8f06c29b0.poster.avif?t=1749584178\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594720/extras/7c57a326a23d713f39eb0be8f06c29b0.webm?t=1749584178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594720/extras/7c57a326a23d713f39eb0be8f06c29b0.mp4?t=1749584178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sangnoire mansion is not just a setting \u2014 it\u2019s a <strong>living, shifting labyrinth</strong> filled with traps, hidden passages, and unnatural forces. Julien is always listening. Always adapting. If he hears you, he will come. If he sees you, he will chase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must stay quiet, stay sharp\u2026 and stay alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Spiritual-Vine Mechanism</strong> <br>Drinking the Sangnoire family wine doesn\u2019t just calm the nerves. It <strong>fractures reality</strong>, opening doors that weren\u2019t there and revealing visions from the past. But be warned: <strong>the more you drink, the harder it becomes to tell what\u2019s real.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Julien Listens and Learns</strong> <br>Julien Sangnoire is more than just a killer \u2014 he\u2019s a predator. His <strong>AI behavior adapts</strong> based on your noise, your hiding spots, and your path. Every decision matters. Every sound can be your last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vintage Survival Puzzle Design</strong> <br>Inspired by early 20th-century machinery, you\u2019ll need to manipulate <strong>pressure valves, fuse boxes, mechanical lifts, and coded drawers</strong> to open new paths and escape routes. There's no hand-holding here \u2014 only tension, logic, and survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Real-Time Horror</strong> <br>Immersive, <strong>cut-free storytelling</strong> \u2014 experience ghostly memories and death sequences in real time, with <strong>no breaks in gameplay flow.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Sangnoire Estate</strong> <br>From secret wine cellars to a forgotten chapel deep underground, the estate hides a story of <strong>grief, ritual, and madness</strong>. Each room brings you closer to the truth\u2026 and closer to Julien.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Distinct Horror Aesthetic</strong> <br>A moody 3D world soaked in dread, blending <strong>historical realism</strong> with <strong>unnatural beauty</strong> \u2014 overgrown vines, flickering oil lamps, and the bloodstained walls of a once-noble house.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594720/extras/dcb4f5e2845f70e00fbf939d8a6e72e6.poster.avif?t=1749584178\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594720/extras/dcb4f5e2845f70e00fbf939d8a6e72e6.webm?t=1749584178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594720/extras/dcb4f5e2845f70e00fbf939d8a6e72e6.mp4?t=1749584178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will you survive the Sangnoire massacre?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will your soul be trapped with the rest of the vineyard\u2019s secrets?</p>",
